<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-GERMANY BEAT PORTUGAL 2-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMANY BEAT PORTUGAL 2-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LEIRIA, Portugal 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany beat Portugal 2-1 (halftime 0-0) in their European under-21 soccer championship group nine qualifier on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Portugal - Bruno Caires 73</p>
<p>Germany - Kai Michalke 52, 54</p>
<p>Attendance: 3,700</p>
